Tests: a page error is logged with the service's words and the page never
gets them (fails with the line switched off); the OpenAI error carries the
status and OpenAI's text and never the key; the note for newer chats (fails
with the note switched off); the Home throws. Checked in a scratch copy of
the app against a local stand-in for OpenAI and JusPrin's server: each
